---
import assets from '../data/assets.json';
import Figure from './Figure.astro';

const {page} = Astro.props;
const asset = (id:string) => (assets as any)[id];
---
<article class="thor-case-study">
  <header class="thor-hero">
    <div class="thor-hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Graduate Research</p>
      <h1>{page.title}</h1>
      <p class="thor-lede"><strong>Validated THOR-5F simulation → quantified restraint-geometry effects</strong></p>
      <dl class="thor-metrics" aria-label="Study scope">
        <div><dd>104</dd><dt>LS-DYNA simulations</dt></div>
        <div><dd>4</dd><dt>full-factorial studies</dt></div>
        <div><dd>2</dd><dt>bench configurations</dt></div>
        <div><dd>0.71</dd><dt>average ISO 18571</dt></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="thor-hero-media"><Figure asset={asset('A01')} number={1} /></div>
  </header>

  <section class="thor-section" id="research-workflow">
    <div class="thor-section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research workflow</p>
      <h2>Physical test → FE validation → anchor-position DOE</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="thor-video-grid thor-video-grid-two">
      <figure class="thor-video-card">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Rigid Bench THOR-5F simulation">
          <source src="/videos/thorrigidbenchgeneralsim.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <figcaption><strong>Rigid Bench</strong> · THOR-5F simulation</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="thor-video-card">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Semi-Rigid Bench THOR-5F simulation">
          <source src="/videos/THORsemiRIGIDBENCHgeneralsim.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <figcaption><strong>Semi-Rigid Bench</strong> · THOR-5F simulation</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <figure class="thor-video-card thor-anchor-video">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="THOR-5F anchor location DOE animation">
        <source src="/videos/THOR_ANCHOR_DOE.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
      <figcaption><strong>Anchor-position DOE</strong> · 104 physically feasible simulations</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="thor-section" id="key-results">
    <div class="thor-section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Key results</p>
      <h2>Results at a glance</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="thor-result-grid">
      <article class="thor-result-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Chest response</span>
        <strong>17% / 16%</strong>
        <p>below the Rigid / Semi-Rigid Bench study averages.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="thor-result-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Validation</span>
        <strong>0.71</strong>
        <p>average ISO 18571 rating in each bench.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="thor-result-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pelvis response</span>
        <strong>Lap anchors</strong>
        <p>had the stronger effect on pelvis acceleration.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="thor-result-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Workflow</span>
        <strong>7 → 4</strong>
        <p>manual belt-fitting setup steps.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="thor-result-visuals">
      <Figure asset={asset('A05')} number={5} />
      <Figure asset={asset('A02')} number={2} />
    </div>

    <div class="thor-link-row">
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/fe-validation/">FE model validation →</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/ls-prepost-automation/">LS-PrePost automation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="thor-section" id="anchor-response">
    <div class="thor-section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Anchor response</p>
      <h2>See the restraint-geometry effects</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-group">
      <h3>Shoulder anchor · fore/aft</h3>
      <div class="comparison-video-grid">
        <figure>
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Rigid Bench shoulder anchor fore-aft comparison">
            <source src="/videos/THOR_RIGID_BENCH_SHOULDER_FOREAFTCOMPARISON.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>Rigid Bench</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Semi-Rigid Bench shoulder anchor fore-aft comparison">
            <source src="/videos/THOR_SEMIRIGID_BENCH_SHOULDER_FOREAFTCOMPARISON.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>Semi-Rigid Bench</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-group">
      <h3>Shoulder anchor · inboard/outboard</h3>
      <div class="comparison-video-grid">
        <figure>
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Rigid Bench shoulder anchor inboard-outboard comparison">
            <source src="/videos/THOR_RIGID_BENCH_SHOULDER_INBOARDOUTBOARDCOMPARISON.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>Rigid Bench</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Semi-Rigid Bench shoulder anchor inboard-outboard comparison">
            <source src="/videos/THOR_SEMIRIGID_BENCH_SHOULDER_INBOARDOUTBOARDCOMPARISON.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>Semi-Rigid Bench</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="thor-section" id="engineering-interpretation">
    <div class="thor-section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Engineering interpretation</p>
      <h2>What changed and why</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="interpretation-grid thor-interpretation-compact">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Rearward shoulder anchor</h3><p>Earlier torso engagement and more gradual load transfer.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Inboard shoulder anchor</h3><p>Improved shoulder contact, with a belt-to-neck tradeoff at the extreme.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Lap anchor</h3><p>More configuration-dependent pelvis response.</p></article>
    </div>

    <aside class="boundary-callout thor-boundary thor-boundary-compact">
      <h3>Study boundary</h3>
      <p>Comparative sensitivity study within the evaluated design space — not a production restraint recommendation.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>
</article>
